  "historyNote": "#6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04 New. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13 New. #10702, INTERIM, eff 10-23-14, EXPIRED: 4-21-15 New. #11031, eff 1-29-16",
